<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_services">TplAppServices</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate menu items and actions for managing multiple services within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for starting, stopping, and restarting all services at once. </para>
